       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-NL PIC X.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE FUNCTION CHAR(11) TO WS-NL.
           IF VWR-1::Fullscreen = 1
               MOVE 0 TO VWR-1::Fullscreen
           ELSE
               MOVE 1 TO VWR-1::Fullscreen
           END-IF.
           Txt-Log::AppendText("Fullscreen toggled").
           Txt-Log::AppendText(WS-NL).
]]></Event>
  </Control>
